    {
      "text": "Combine broth, tomatoes, kidney beans, onion, carrots, celery, green beans, zucchini, garlic, parsley, oregano, salt, thyme, and pepper in a 6-quart slow cooker. Cover and cook on Low for 6 to 8 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qWSqMiF9_KXLW9zRuFSffQSTyv8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230298-ddmfs-slow-cooker-vegetarian-minestrone-step3-0053-8900a5307959478a87a724c16dee52d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230298/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook elbow macaroni in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until cooked through but firm to the bite, 8 minutes; drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bSXyO2Zg4Ilb86UAOrCUgClMCXY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230298-ddmfs-slow-cooker-vegetarian-minestrone-step3-0055-f7faedf08a0a4fbe8756c8e330355f57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230298/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir macaroni and spinach into the slow cooker; cover and cook for 15 more minutes.",
